💰 Budget Tracker System

A simple and responsive Budget Tracker System built with HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to help users manage, track, and organize their daily expenses.

📌 About the Project

The Budget Tracker System is a money-management dashboard where users can add and manage expenses, view spending summaries, filter transactions by category, and sort expenses based on date.
The project focuses on creating a clean, simple, and user-friendly interface while practicing JavaScript DOM manipulation and dynamic data handling.

✨ Features

📊 Dashboard Summary

Total Spent
This Month's Spending
Largest Expense
Total Number of Transactions

📝 Expense Management

Add expenses

Edit existing expenses
Delete expenses
Enter date, category, description, and amount

🔎 Filter & Sort

Filter expenses by category
Sort transactions by date

💵 Dynamic Calculations

Automatically calculates total spending
Displays the largest expense
Updates transaction count
Updates monthly spending

📱 Responsive Design

Clean dashboard layout
Easy-to-use forms and buttons
Designed for a smooth user experience across screen sizes

🛠️ Technologies Used

HTML5 – Structure and layout
CSS3 – Styling, cards, forms, buttons, and responsive design
JavaScript – Expense management, calculations, filtering, sorting, and DOM manipulation

